  "details": "1. Be able to \"verify\" avatars first -> I see it as normal, the stream cam shows it as Robot, I have a button to \"show/hide on streamer cam\"\n2. I should be able to setup the lobby as \"Streaming\" so that everyone knows it\n3. It would be cool to connect VRChat to Twitch, so that my viewers can join me more easily\n4. A Chat / Text Chatting featrue for mute or shy poeple would be nice at least for one Basic Avatar\n5. Streamer Cam doesn't need to have like filters etc. and the pinning needs to be fixed, so that I can say like: Save Actual Position / Load Pos 1, 2, 3 for example.\nGreetings\nAndre | ThunderSturmVR",
